WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.144
The Site Map joins decision, people, process,
technology, data, constraints, incentives, and

00:00:06.214 --> 00:00:08.753
history. Recon creates version zero.

00:00:08.823 --> 00:00:11.447
Immerse checks it and produces version one.

00:00:11.517 --> 00:00:16.317
Include verification status rather than
filling gaps with plausible detail.

00:00:16.387 --> 00:00:22.339
Incentives deserve explicit attention: automation
may remove visible work while increasing

00:00:22.409 --> 00:00:24.926
accountability or perceived job risk.

00:00:24.996 --> 00:00:30.905
The map is a decision aid, so emphasize
dependencies that affect the proposed experiment and

00:00:30.975 --> 00:00:32.362
who can resolve them.

00:00:32.432 --> 00:00:37.189
Agents fear that faster triage will
become an individual performance target.

00:00:37.259 --> 00:00:39.137
Maya wants reliable routing.

00:00:39.207 --> 00:00:41.233
Priya needs a data boundary.

00:00:41.303 --> 00:00:43.522
Luis needs a documented fallback.

00:00:43.592 --> 00:00:48.264
These interests shape adoption even if
the same software works for everyone.

00:00:48.334 --> 00:00:53.113
Pause the video and complete this exercise
before opening the worked response.

00:00:53.183 --> 00:00:55.231
Complete all eight Site Map fields.

00:00:55.301 --> 00:00:59.866
Leave unresolved facts explicitly
unknown and attach a next action.

00:00:59.936 --> 00:01:06.421
The completed map names Maya as workflow owner,
Priya as access approver, and Luis as API

00:01:06.491 --> 00:01:13.190
maintainer. It records synthetic data as the course
boundary, human approval as a fixed experimental

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:18.999
condition, private notes as an observed behavior,
and production permissions as unresolved.

00:01:19.069 --> 00:01:24.189
The next action is an operator review of
the frame before any production integration.

00:01:24.259 --> 00:01:26.520
What belongs in an unresolved field?

00:01:26.590 --> 00:01:29.043
A. A plausible invented answer B.

00:01:29.113 --> 00:01:31.439
Nothing, so the map looks complete C.

00:01:31.509 --> 00:01:34.261
Unknown, owner, and verification action.

00:01:34.331 --> 00:01:35.739
The best answer is C.

00:01:35.809 --> 00:01:38.667
Visible uncertainty makes the map actionable.
